// AmazonGoldenSkirmisherTokenCounter: stacks 1-40: 0.5% Attack Speed each (stacks of AmazonGoldenSkirmisherAttackSpeed, script); 41-80: 1% shorter Slows and Stuns each (script); 100: 1% maximum Health on Basic Attacks (script); then 1.5% all damage past 100
